{"stem": "mono_synth", "name": "mono_synth", "description": "Monophonic synthesizer \u2014 music_note event \u2192 oscillator \u2192 filter \u2192 envelope\n\nA complete single-voice synthesizer driven by a `crag.event_struct` carrying\na `music_note` payload (pitch in MIDI note numbers, velocity in [0, 1]).\n\nSignal flow:\n  note_on event \u2192 MIDI pitch \u2192 frequency \u2192 sawtooth oscillator\n                                         \u2192 resonant low-pass filter\n                                         \u2192 ADSR amplitude envelope\n                                         \u2192 velocity scale\n                                         \u2192 output\n\nParameters:\n  cutoff_hz   [200, 8000] Hz  \u2014 filter cutoff frequency (default 2000 Hz)\n  attack_ms   [1,   2000] ms \u2014 ADSR attack time  (default  10 ms)\n  decay_ms    [1,   2000] ms \u2014 ADSR decay time   (default 200 ms)\n  sustain     [0,      1]    \u2014 ADSR sustain level (default 0.8)\n  release_ms  [1,   5000] ms \u2014 ADSR release time (default 300 ms)\n\nEvents:\n  note_on (struct music_note) \u2014 starts a note; pitch sets the oscillator\n                                frequency, velocity scales the output.\n\nOutput: !crag.audio<f32, 0, 1> \u2014 mono synthesizer signal\n\nNote on pitch/velocity persistence: the per-event host-pointer global\n(crag_event_struct_N_ptr) retains the last host-supplied pointer across\nblocks, so `%pitch` and `%vel` reflect the most-recently-fired note's\nvalues even in non-trigger blocks.  The ADSR handles timing via `%fired`\nand `%at`.", "sr": 48000, "ch": 1, "build_meta": {"gen_datetime": "2026-07-04 14:46 UTC", "git_commit": "2673c34", "compiled_with": "a71dcc0"}, "wasm": "mono_synth.wasm", "meta_file": "mono_synth.wasm.cragmeta", "meta": {"schema_version": 1, "sample_rate": 48000, "channels": 1, "parameters": [{"name": "cutoff_hz", "type": "float", "min": 200.0, "max": 8000.0, "default": 2000.0, "unit": "hz", "float_index": 0}, {"name": "attack_ms", "type": "float", "min": 1.0, "max": 2000.0, "default": 10.0, "unit": "ms", "float_index": 1}, {"name": "decay_ms", "type": "float", "min": 1.0, "max": 2000.0, "default": 200.0, "unit": "ms", "float_index": 2}, {"name": "sustain", "type": "float", "min": 0.0, "max": 1.0, "default": 0.8, "float_index": 3}, {"name": "release_ms", "type": "float", "min": 1.0, "max": 5000.0, "default": 300.0, "unit": "ms", "float_index": 4}], "samplers": [], "texture_samplers": [], "events": [{"name": "note_on", "type": "struct", "subtype": "music_note", "int_index": 0, "struct_payload_bytes": 8, "struct_fields": [{"name": "pitch", "type": "f32", "offset": 0, "min": 0.0, "max": 127.0}, {"name": "velocity", "type": "f32", "offset": 4, "min": 0.0, "max": 1.0}]}], "meters": [{"name": "Output", "type": "float", "min": 0.0, "max": 1.0, "float_index": 0}], "has_visualizer": true, "has_audio_output": true, "viz_width": 512, "viz_height": 256, "compiled_with": "a71dcc0"}, "mca": {"graph": "mono_synth", "block_size": 512, "results": [{"label": "Intel Haswell (x86-64-v3)", "triple": "x86_64-linux-gnu", "march": "x86-64", "mcpu": "haswell", "arch": "x86-64", "ipc": 1.2951, "block_rthroughput": 156.0, "cycles_per_sample": 0.3047, "insns_per_block": 426, "uops_per_block": 624}, {"label": "Intel Skylake-AVX512 (x86-64-v4)", "triple": "x86_64-linux-gnu", "march": "x86-64", "mcpu": "skylake-avx512", "arch": "x86-64", "ipc": 1.557, "block_rthroughput": 102.0, "cycles_per_sample": 0.1992, "insns_per_block": 427, "uops_per_block": 612}, {"label": "AMD Zen 3 (znver3)", "triple": "x86_64-linux-gnu", "march": "x86-64", "mcpu": "znver3", "arch": "x86-64", "ipc": 2.4018, "block_rthroughput": 71.83, "cycles_per_sample": 0.1403, "insns_per_block": 426, "uops_per_block": 431}]}, "spectrograms": [], "svg_bundle": {"graphs": {"<top>": {"svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 323 178\" width=\"323\" height=\"178\">\n<defs><marker id=\"fwd_audio\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" re